    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3559" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρο-θώραξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱκος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θωρήσσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>slightly drunk</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμιμέθυσος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				871a9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.656c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπωκότ᾽ ἤδη τ᾽ ἀκροθώρακ᾽ ὄντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					46
				</span></i>
			: 
				Ion.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρο-θώρηξ</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. Erot.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θωρῆξαι</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>well drunken</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.390
			</span></i>.</div>
